// Pure social/utility spell ("guaranteed strong social checks, immune to
// truth-detection") -- no dialogue/skill-check system exists to hook a
// guaranteed-success grant into, same category of gap as the deferred
// Necromancy revive spells. `Fearless` (confidence flavor) is the closest
// existing thematic stand-in shipped, not a mechanical match for the
// sheet's real effect -- documented as an honest approximation.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.25,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Fearless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.0, duration: Some(3600.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 60.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 8 spell -> min_level 48, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(48)),
    ),
)
